  "description": "In the once peaceful Goat Village, Woo I-ram suddenly became a cursed omen.\n\nShunned and burdened with despair, she made a decision— to end it all by seeking out a wolf to devour her.\n\nBut there was just one problem…\n\nThis wolf wasn’t normal.\n\nAs she embarks on a journey toward what she believes to be the perfect death, I-ram begins to question everything.\n\nCan she find a reason to live… in the last place she expected?",
